<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><x:worksheet xmlns:x="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/spreadsheetml/2006/main"><x:sheetFormatPr defaultRowHeight="15" /><x:cols><x:col min="1" max="1" width="28" hidden="0" customWidth="1" /><x:col min="2" max="2" width="42" hidden="0" customWidth="1" /><x:col min="3" max="3" width="48" hidden="0" customWidth="1" /><x:col min="4" max="4" width="36" hidden="0" customWidth="1" /><x:col min="5" max="5" width="16" hidden="0" customWidth="1" /><x:col min="6" max="6" width="46" hidden="0" customWidth="1" /></x:cols><x:sheetData><x:row r="1" ht="26" customHeight="1"><x:c r="A1" s="284" t="str"><x:v>04 — QA / RELEASE GATE</x:v></x:c><x:c r="B1" s="284" /><x:c r="C1" s="284" /><x:c r="D1" s="284" /><x:c r="E1" s="284" /><x:c r="F1" s="284" /></x:row><x:row r="2" ht="30" customHeight="1"><x:c r="A2" s="287" t="str"><x:v>Release hierarchy: FAIL &gt; INPUT REQUIRED &gt; REVIEW REQUIRED &gt; PASS. N/A is acceptable only when the associated engineering module is genuinely not applicable.</x:v></x:c><x:c r="B2" s="287" /><x:c r="C2" s="287" /><x:c r="D2" s="287" /><x:c r="E2" s="287" /><x:c r="F2" s="287" /></x:row><x:row r="3"><x:c r="A3" s="308" /><x:c r="B3" s="308" /><x:c r="C3" s="308" /><x:c r="D3" s="308" /><x:c r="E3" s="308" /><x:c r="F3" s="308" /></x:row><x:row r="4" ht="28" customHeight="1"><x:c r="A4" s="293" t="str"><x:v>Step / Module</x:v></x:c><x:c r="B4" s="293" t="str"><x:v>Release State</x:v></x:c><x:c r="C4" s="293" t="str"><x:v>Acceptance Criterion</x:v></x:c><x:c r="D4" s="293" t="str"><x:v>Key Source / Engine</x:v></x:c><x:c r="E4" s="293" t="str"><x:v>QA Interpretation</x:v></x:c><x:c r="F4" s="293" t="str"><x:v>Action if Not PASS</x:v></x:c></x:row><x:row r="5"><x:c r="A5" s="307" t="str"><x:v>Step 2 — Cable Intelligence</x:v></x:c><x:c r="B5" s="308" t="str"><x:f>'CABLE_SUMMARY'!$B$12</x:f><x:v>REVIEW REQUIRED</x:v></x:c><x:c r="C5" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Verified/approved cable identity or explicit review gate</x:v></x:c><x:c r="D5" s="308" t="str"><x:v>CABLE_SUMMARY</x:v></x:c><x:c r="E5" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Normal user data is entered through EASY_INPUT; advanced cable/source checks remain available in INPUTS.</x:v></x:c><x:c r="F5" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Use INPUTS only if a rare manual override is specifically required.</x:v></x:c></x:row><x:row r="6"><x:c r="A6" s="307" t="str"><x:v>Step 3 — Tray Type</x:v></x:c><x:c r="B6" s="308" t="str"><x:f>'TRAY_TYPE'!$B$14</x:f><x:v>PASS</x:v></x:c><x:c r="C6" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Automatic application decision</x:v></x:c><x:c r="D6" s="308" t="str"><x:v>TRAY_TYPE</x:v></x:c><x:c r="E6" s="308" t="str"><x:v>User does not preselect tray type</x:v></x:c><x:c r="F6" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Provide missing application facts.</x:v></x:c></x:row><x:row r="7"><x:c r="A7" s="307" t="str"><x:v>Step 4 — NEC Fill / Width</x:v></x:c><x:c r="B7" s="308" t="str"><x:f>'FILL_WIDTH'!$B$20</x:f><x:v>PASS</x:v></x:c><x:c r="C7" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Applicable NEC branch + commercial width resolution</x:v></x:c><x:c r="D7" s="308" t="str"><x:v>FILL_WIDTH</x:v></x:c><x:c r="E7" s="308" t="str"><x:v>No fabricated tray width</x:v></x:c><x:c r="F7" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Resolve code/layout condition.</x:v></x:c></x:row><x:row r="8"><x:c r="A8" s="307" t="str"><x:v>Step 5 — Material / Finish</x:v></x:c><x:c r="B8" s="308" t="str"><x:f>'MATERIAL'!$B$15</x:f><x:v>PASS</x:v></x:c><x:c r="C8" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Environment/temperature suitability</x:v></x:c><x:c r="D8" s="308" t="str"><x:v>MATERIAL</x:v></x:c><x:c r="E8" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Material follows site conditions</x:v></x:c><x:c r="F8" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Confirm severe environment/source.</x:v></x:c></x:row><x:row r="9"><x:c r="A9" s="307" t="str"><x:v>Step 6 — Mechanical Product</x:v></x:c><x:c r="B9" s="308" t="str"><x:f>'PRODUCT_SELECT'!$B$26</x:f><x:v>REVIEW REQUIRED</x:v></x:c><x:c r="C9" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Verified product meets geometry/load/span</x:v></x:c><x:c r="D9" s="308" t="str"><x:v>PRODUCT_SELECT</x:v></x:c><x:c r="E9" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Actual Eaton product is selected</x:v></x:c><x:c r="F9" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Provide real support/load constraint.</x:v></x:c></x:row><x:row r="10"><x:c r="A10" s="307" t="str"><x:v>Step 7 — Bend / Fitting Radius</x:v></x:c><x:c r="B10" s="308" t="str"><x:f>'BENDS_FITTINGS'!$B$17</x:f><x:v>PASS</x:v></x:c><x:c r="C10" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Manufacturer cable bend data supports fitting geometry</x:v></x:c><x:c r="D10" s="308" t="str"><x:v>BENDS_FITTINGS</x:v></x:c><x:c r="E10" s="308" t="str"><x:v>No guessed bend radius</x:v></x:c><x:c r="F10" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Obtain missing cable data.</x:v></x:c></x:row><x:row r="11"><x:c r="A11" s="307" t="str"><x:v>Step 8 — Route Fittings</x:v></x:c><x:c r="B11" s="308" t="str"><x:f>'ROUTE_FITTINGS'!$B$31</x:f><x:v>PASS</x:v></x:c><x:c r="C11" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Route geometry / fitting selection sufficiently defined</x:v></x:c><x:c r="D11" s="308" t="str"><x:v>ROUTE_FITTINGS</x:v></x:c><x:c r="E11" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Current 90°/45° fittings resolve to the 6-in-side-rail aluminum solid-bottom catalog family. IDs are catalog-pattern verified, not falsely represented as exact SKU-page matches.</x:v></x:c><x:c r="F11" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Obtain project/vendor confirmation if procurement requires exact SKU-page/submittal verification of the generated fitting IDs.</x:v></x:c></x:row><x:row r="12"><x:c r="A12" s="307" t="str"><x:v>Step 9 — Expansion / Supports</x:v></x:c><x:c r="B12" s="308" t="str"><x:f>'EXPANSION_SUPPORTS'!$B$23</x:f><x:v>REVIEW REQUIRED</x:v></x:c><x:c r="C12" s="308" t="str"><x:v>NEMA thermal/support logic resolved</x:v></x:c><x:c r="D12" s="308" t="str"><x:v>EXPANSION_SUPPORTS</x:v></x:c><x:c r="E12" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Aluminum expansion-splice/clamp-guide families and 36-in heavy-duty trapeze support family are source-backed; final building attachment remains structural.</x:v></x:c><x:c r="F12" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Coordinate top attachment and 1/2-in threaded-rod length with structural design before IFC.</x:v></x:c></x:row><x:row r="13"><x:c r="A13" s="307" t="str"><x:v>Step 10 — Cable Cleats</x:v></x:c><x:c r="B13" s="308" t="str"><x:f>'CLEAT_SUMMARY'!$B$14</x:f><x:v>PASS</x:v></x:c><x:c r="C13" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Trefoil + qualifying 3-phase flat source-backed; single-phase/DC review-gated</x:v></x:c><x:c r="D13" s="308" t="str"><x:v>CLEAT_SUMMARY</x:v></x:c><x:c r="E13" s="308" t="str"><x:v>No source-mapped formation may silently auto-select the wrong cleat family.</x:v></x:c><x:c r="F13" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Provide fault duty/formation detail or arrangement-specific restraint design only when required.</x:v></x:c></x:row><x:row r="14"><x:c r="A14" s="307" t="str"><x:v>Step 11 — Grounding / Accessories</x:v></x:c><x:c r="B14" s="308" t="str"><x:f>'GROUNDING'!$B$46</x:f><x:v>REVIEW REQUIRED</x:v></x:c><x:c r="C14" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Grounding path and required accessories resolved</x:v></x:c><x:c r="D14" s="308" t="str"><x:v>GROUNDING</x:v></x:c><x:c r="E14" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Dedicated wire EGC governs. Exact 807A-36-144 cover and 9A-36-9064 heavy-duty clamp are manufacturer verified; divider/drop-out/grounding families are source-backed. High-wind quantity remains project-specific.</x:v></x:c><x:c r="F14" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Provide project wind criteria / approved cover-restraint detail to close the high-wind review.</x:v></x:c></x:row><x:row r="15"><x:c r="A15" s="307" t="str"><x:v>Step 12 — Complete BOM</x:v></x:c><x:c r="B15" s="308" t="str"><x:f>'BOM'!$B$93</x:f><x:v>REVIEW REQUIRED</x:v></x:c><x:c r="C15" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Procurement schedule carries all unresolved gates</x:v></x:c><x:c r="D15" s="308" t="str"><x:v>BOM</x:v></x:c><x:c r="E15" s="308" t="str"><x:v>The active hardware database is strengthened and no generic active item is left as SOURCE REQUIRED. Remaining reviews are explicit: catalog-pattern tray/fittings, EGC/fiber approval, structural attachment/rod length, and high-wind cover restraint.</x:v></x:c><x:c r="F15" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Close only those project/procurement-specific reviews; do not replace them with guessed data.</x:v></x:c></x:row><x:row r="16"><x:c r="A16" s="307" t="str"><x:v>Final Ampacity — NEC 2020/2023</x:v></x:c><x:c r="B16" s="308" t="str"><x:f>'AMPACITY_SUMMARY'!$B$13</x:f><x:v>PASS</x:v></x:c><x:c r="C16" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Edition-specific NEC route + ambient + CCC + tray/cover + lower valid source limit</x:v></x:c><x:c r="D16" s="308" t="str"><x:v>AMPACITY_SUMMARY</x:v></x:c><x:c r="E16" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Numerical NEC ampacity result is reported independently from procurement/source review notes.</x:v></x:c><x:c r="F16" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Correct only if numerical ampacity FAIL or a genuinely required electrical quantity is absent.</x:v></x:c></x:row><x:row r="17"><x:c r="A17" s="1187" t="str"><x:v>Step 1 — Project Input Sanity</x:v></x:c><x:c r="B17" s="1187" t="str"><x:f>IF(COUNTIF('ISSUES'!$C$29:$C$37,"FAIL")&gt;0,"FAIL",IF(COUNTIF('ISSUES'!$C$29:$C$37,"INPUT REQUIRED")&gt;0,"INPUT REQUIRED",IF(COUNTIF('ISSUES'!$C$29:$C$37,"REVIEW REQUIRED")&gt;0,"REVIEW REQUIRED","PASS")))</x:f><x:v>PASS</x:v></x:c><x:c r="C17" s="1187" t="str"><x:v>Critical contradictory/missing normal-user inputs are gated</x:v></x:c><x:c r="D17" s="1187" t="str"><x:v>ISSUES rows 29:37</x:v></x:c><x:c r="E17" s="1187" t="str"><x:v>Input sanity participates in core release</x:v></x:c><x:c r="F17" s="1187" t="str"><x:v>Correct highlighted EASY_INPUT values before release.</x:v></x:c></x:row><x:row r="18" ht="24" customHeight="1"><x:c r="A18" s="297" t="str"><x:v>FINAL RELEASE SUMMARY</x:v></x:c><x:c r="B18" s="297" /><x:c r="C18" s="297" /><x:c r="D18" s="297" /><x:c r="E18" s="297" /><x:c r="F18" s="297" /></x:row><x:row r="19" ht="28" customHeight="1"><x:c r="A19" s="293" t="str"><x:v>FINAL RELEASE SUMMARY</x:v></x:c><x:c r="B19" s="293" /><x:c r="C19" s="293" /><x:c r="D19" s="293" /><x:c r="E19" s="293" /><x:c r="F19" s="293" /></x:row><x:row r="20"><x:c r="A20" s="308" t="str"><x:v>ENGINEERING CALCULATION RELEASE</x:v></x:c><x:c r="B20" s="308" t="str"><x:f>IF(B21&gt;0,"FAIL",IF(B22&gt;0,"INPUT REQUIRED","PASS"))</x:f><x:v>PASS</x:v></x:c><x:c r="C20" s="276" t="str"><x:v>FAIL and INPUT REQUIRED from legacy core gates or additive structural/fitting engines block the calculator. REVIEW REQUIRED stays in Procurement / IFC.</x:v></x:c><x:c r="D20" s="276" /><x:c r="E20" s="276" /><x:c r="F20" s="276" /></x:row><x:row r="21"><x:c r="A21" s="308" t="str"><x:v>FAIL gates</x:v></x:c><x:c r="B21" s="308" t="n"><x:f>COUNTIF(B5:B17,"FAIL")+IF(B24="FAIL",1,0)</x:f><x:v>0</x:v></x:c><x:c r="C21" s="276" /><x:c r="D21" s="276" /><x:c r="E21" s="276" /><x:c r="F21" s="276" /></x:row><x:row r="22"><x:c r="A22" s="308" t="str"><x:v>INPUT REQUIRED gates</x:v></x:c><x:c r="B22" s="308" t="n"><x:f>COUNTIF(B5:B17,"INPUT REQUIRED")+IF(B24="INPUT REQUIRED",1,0)</x:f><x:v>0</x:v></x:c><x:c r="C22" s="276" /><x:c r="D22" s="276" /><x:c r="E22" s="276" /><x:c r="F22" s="276" /></x:row><x:row r="23"><x:c r="A23" s="308" t="str"><x:v>REVIEW-gated modules</x:v></x:c><x:c r="B23" s="308" t="n"><x:f>COUNTIF(B5:B17,"REVIEW REQUIRED")+IF(STRUCTURAL_LOADING!B27="REVIEW REQUIRED",1,0)+IF(FITTING_FILL!B23="REVIEW REQUIRED",1,0)</x:f><x:v>7</x:v></x:c><x:c r="C23" s="276" /><x:c r="D23" s="276" /><x:c r="E23" s="276" /><x:c r="F23" s="276" /></x:row><x:row r="24"><x:c r="A24" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Additive core calculation gate</x:v></x:c><x:c r="B24" s="308" t="str"><x:f>IF(OR(STRUCTURAL_LOADING!B26="FAIL",FITTING_FILL!B22="FAIL"),"FAIL",IF(OR(STRUCTURAL_LOADING!B26="INPUT REQUIRED",FITTING_FILL!B22="INPUT REQUIRED"),"INPUT REQUIRED","PASS"))</x:f><x:v>PASS</x:v></x:c><x:c r="C24" s="308" t="str"><x:v>Structural numerical + fitting geometry/route-required inputs</x:v></x:c><x:c r="D24" s="308" /><x:c r="E24" s="308" /><x:c r="F24" s="308" /></x:row><x:row r="25"><x:c r="A25" s="308" t="str"><x:v>PROCUREMENT / IFC STA